\"div\",\"p-2\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":\"Gas langsung aja kita bedah arsitekturnya!\"}]\n15:[\"$\",\"h1\",\"h1-0\",{\"children\":\"Pembahasan Arsitektur\"}]\n16:[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-3\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"img\",\"img-0\",{\"src\":\"/assets/images/lks/topology-serverless.png\",\"alt\":\"topology\"}]}]\n17:[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-4\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":[\"Konsepnya sederhana tapi \",[\"$\",\"em\",\"em-0\",{\"children\":\"powerful\"}],\". Kita gak mau user nunggu lama cuma buat nunggu proses database selesai. Jadi kita pake metode \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-white font-bold\",\"children\":\"Asinkronus\"}],\".\"]}]\n18:[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-5\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-white font-bold\",\"children\":\"Alur Datanya kayak gini:\"}]}]\n19:[\"$\",\"ol\",\"ol-0\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-white font-bold\",\"children\":\"User\"}],\" ngirim request HTTP (misal: menambah barang) ke \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-1\",{\"className\":\"text-white font-bold\",\"children\":\"ALB\"}],\".\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-1\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-white font-bold\",\"children\":\"ALB\"}],\" nerusin request ke \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-1\",{\"className\":\"text-white font-bold\",\"children\":\"Lambda Ingest\"}],\".\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-2\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-white font-bold\",\"children\":\"Lambda Ingest\"}],\" gak langsung nulis ke DB, tapi dia cuma \\\"nitip\\\" pesan ke \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-1\",{\"className\":\"text-white font-bold\",\"children\":\"SQS\"}],\". Abis itu dia langsung bilang \\\"Oke, diterima\\\" ke User. Cepet kan?\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-3\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-white font-bold\",\"children\":\"SQS\"}],\" nampung pesan-pesan itu dalam antrian.\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-4\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-white font-bold\",\"children\":\"Lambda Process\"}],\" (yang dipicu oleh SQS) bakal ngambil pesan dari antrian dan memprosesnya (misal: simpen ke \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-1\",{\"className\":\"text-white font-bold\",\"children\":\"DynamoDB\"}],\").\"]}],\"\\n\"]}]\n1a:[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-6\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":\"Dengan cara ini, frontend user bakal ngerasa aplikasinya ngebut banget, padahal di belakang layar prosesnya lagi ngantri dengan rapih.\"}]\n1b:[\"$\",\"h1\",\"h1-1\",{\"children\":\"Langkah Implementasi\"}]\n1c:[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-7\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":[\"Biar gak bingung, kita bagi jadi beberapa \",[\"$\",\"em\",\"em-0\",{\"children\":\"part\"}],\" ya. Siapin kopi kalian, \",[\"$\",\"em\",\"em-1\",{\"children\":\"let's dive in!\"}]]}]\n1d:[\"$\",\"h3\",\"h3-0\",{\"className\":\"font-headline text-2xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mt-10 mb-3\",\"children\":\"1. persyaratan awal\"}]\n1e:[\"$\",\"ul\",\"ul-0\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-0\",{\"children\":[\"VPC sudah ada dengan configurasi\",\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"ul\",\"ul-0\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-0\",{\"children\":\"4 Subnet (Public dan Private masing - masing 2)\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-1\",{\"children\":\"Internet Gateway\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-2\",{\"children\":\"RTB untuk subnet Public dan RTB untuk masing - masing subnet Private\"}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-1\",{\"children\":[\"SG dengan Inbound Port\",\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"ul\",\"ul-0\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-0\",{\"children\":\"HTTP: 80\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-1\",{\"children\":\"HTTPS: 443\"}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\"]}]\n1f:[\"$\",\"h3\",\"h3-1\",{\"className\":\"font-headline text-2xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mt-10 mb-3\",\"children\":\"2. Siapin Database (DynamoDB)\"}]\n20:[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-8\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":[\"Pertama, kita butuh tempat buat nyimpen data akhirnya. Kita pake DynamoDB karena dia \",[\"$\",\"em\",\"em-0\",{\"children\":\"serverless\"}],\" dan \",[\"$\",\"em\",\"em-1\",{\"children\":\"fast\"}],\".\"]}]\n21:[\"$\",\"ul\",\"ul-1\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-0\",{\"children\":[\"Buka console DynamoDB, klik \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-white font-bold\",\"children\":\"Create table\"}],\".\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-1\",{\"children\":[\"Isi nama tabel dan Partition key-nya sesuai kebutuhan. berikut contoh yang saya pakai, setelah itu click \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-0\",{\"children\":\"Create\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"ul\",\"ul-0\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-0\",{\"children\":[\"Partition Key: \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-0\",{\"children\":\"order_id\"}]]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-1\",{\"children\":[\"Sort Key: \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-0\",{\"children\":\"item\"}]]}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\"]}]\n22:[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-9\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"img\",\"img-0\",{\"src\":\"/assets/images/lks/dynamodb1.png\",\"alt\":\"DynamoDB Setup\"}]}]\n23:[\"$\",\"h3\",\"h3-2\",{\"className\":\"font-headline text-2xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mt-10 mb-3\",\"children\":\"3. Buat Queue Service (SQS)\"}]\n24:[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-10\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":\"Ini dia pahlawan kita, si penampung load data.\"}]\n25:[\"$\",\"ul\",\"ul-2\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-0\",{\"children\":[\"Masuk ke service SQS, pilih \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-white font-bold\",\"children\":\"Create queue\"}],\".\"]}],\"\\n\"]}]\n26:[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-11\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"img\",\"img-0\",{\"src\":\"/assets/images/lks/sqs1.png\",\"alt\":\"SQS Setup 1\"}]}]\n27:[\"$\",\"ul\",\"ul-3\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-0\",{\"children\":[\"Pilih tipe \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-white font-bold\",\"children\":\"Standard\"}],\" aja biar throughput-nya tinggi dan prosesnya lebih cepat. Lalu fill nama nya, exp \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-0\",{\"children\":\"vian-sqs\"}],\". lalu klik \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-1\",{\"children\":\"Create\"}],\".\"]}],\"\\n\"]}]\n28:[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-12\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"img\",\"img-0\",{\"src\":\"/assets/images/lks/sqs2.png\",\"alt\":\"SQS Setup 2\"}]}]\n29:[\"$\",\"ul\",\"ul-4\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-0\",{\"children\":\"Kemudian simpan link hasil SQS untuk di pakai di Lambda Ingest.\"}],\"\\n\"]}]\n2a:[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-13\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"img\",\"img-0\",{\"src\":\"/assets/images/lks/sqs3.png\",\"alt\":\"SQS Setup 3\"}]}]\n2b:[\"$\",\"h3\",\"h3-3\",{\"className\":\"font-headline text-2xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mt-10 mb-3\",\"children\":\"4. Lambda Ingest\"}]\n2c:[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-14\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":[\"Sekarang kita buat Lambda function pertama, si \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-0\",{\"children\":\"IngestFunction\"}],\". Tugasnya cuma nerima data dari ALB terus lempar ke SQS.\"]}]\n2d:[\"$\",\"ul\",\"ul-5\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-0\",{\"children\":[\"Buat function baru, kasih nama yang kece (misal: \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-0\",{\"children\":\"Ingest-vian\"}],\").\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-1\",{\"children\":\"Pilih Runtime Python.\"}],\"\\n\"]}]\n2e:[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-15\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"img\",\"img-0\",{\"src\":\"/assets/images/lks/lambda1.png\",\"alt\":\"Create Lambda Ingest 1\"}]}]\n2f:[\"$\",\"ul\",\"ul-6\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-0\",{\"children\":[\"Pastiin IAM Role-nya punya akses buat \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-white font-bold\",\"children\":\"sqs:SendMessage\"}],\" ke SQS Queue yang udah kita buat. Pada kali ini karena saya pakai AWS Academy, jadi bisa pakai \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-0\",{\"children\":\"LabRole\"}]]}],\"\\n\"]}]\n30:[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-16\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"img\",\"img-0\",{\"src\":\"/assets/images/lks/lambda2.png\",\"alt\":\"Create Lambda Ingest 2\"}]}]\n31:[\"$\",\"ul\",\"ul-7\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-0\",{\"children\":\"Enable konfigurasi VPC yang akan di pakai di Lammbda Ingest.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-1\",{\"children\":\"Pilih subnet Private sesuai dengan topologi.\"}],\"\\n\"]}]\n32:[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-17\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"img\",\"img-0\",{\"src\":\"/assets/images/lks/lambda3.png\",\"alt\":\"Create Lambda Ingest 3\"}]}]\n33:[\"$\",\"ul\",\"ul-8\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-0\",{\"children\":\"Pilih Security Group yang sudah di buat dengan Inbound port 80 dan 443.\"}],\"\\n\"]}]\n34:[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-18\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"img\",\"img-0\",{\"src\":\"/assets/images/lks/lambda4.png\",\"alt\":\"Create Lambda Ingest 4\"}]}]\n35:[\"$\",\"ul\",\"ul-9\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-0\",{\"children\":[\"Berikut adalah script untuk \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-0\",{\"children\":\"IngestFunction\"}],\". Script ini akan menerima event dari ALB, mengambil body request, dan mengirimkannya sebagai pesan ke SQS.\"]}],\"\\n\"]}]\n62:T4d5,import json\nimport boto3\nimport os\n\n# Inisialisasi client di luar handler agar lebih cepat (Global)\nsqs = boto3.client('sqs')\nQUEUE_URL = \"{PASTE-URL-SQS}\"\n\ndef lambda_handler(event, context):\n    print(\"EVENT DARI ALB:\", json.dumps(event))\n  \n    path = event.get('path', '/')\n    method = event.get('httpMethod', 'UNKNOWN')\n  \n    # Sesuaikan dengan path yang ada di trigger, exp: /lambda/api\n    if path == \"/lambda/api\" and method == \"POST\":\n        try:\n            body_raw = event.get('body', '{}')\n          \n            sqs.send_message(\n                QueueUrl=QUEUE_URL,\n                MessageBody=body_raw\n            )\n          \n            return {\n                \"statusCode\": 200,\n                \"headers\": {\"Content-Type\": \"application/json\"},\n                \"body\": json.dumps({\"status\": \"Success\", \"msg\": \"Data masuk antrean SQS\"})\n            }\n        except Exception as e:\n            print(f\"CRITICAL ERROR SQS: {str(e)}\")\n            return {\n                \"statusCode\": 500,\n                \"body\": json.dumps({\"error\": f\"Gagal kirim ke SQS: {str(e)}\"})\n            }\n  \n    else:\n        return {\n            \"statusCode\": 404,\n            \"body\": json.dumps({\"error\": f\"Path {path} salah\"})\n        }\n36:[\"$\",\"div\",\"pre-0\",{\"className\":\"rounded-xl overflow-x-auto bg-surface-container-lowest border border-outline-variant/10 my-6 w-full shadow-lg\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center justify-between px-4 py-2 bg-surface-container-high border-b border-outline-variant/10 min-w-max\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"font-label text-[0.6875rem] text-outline uppercase tracking-widest\",\"children\":\"python\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex gap-1.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-error/40\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-primary/40\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-secondary/40\"}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"pre\",null,{\"className\":\"p-6 text-sm font-mono text-primary-fixed/80 leading-relaxed w-full min-w-max whitespace-pre\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-0\",{\"className\":\"language-python\",\"children\":\"$62\"}]}]]}]\n37:[\"$\",\"h3\",\"h3-4\",{\"className\":\"font-headline text-2xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mt-10 mb-3\",\"children\":\"5. Target Group\"}]\n38:[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-19\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":[\"Biar \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-0\",{\"children\":\"IngestFunction\"}],\" bisa diakses dari internet, kita butuh ALB.\"]}]\n39:[\"$\",\"ul\",\"ul-10\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-0\",{\"children\":[\"Buat Target Group baru, pilih target type \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-white font-bold\",\"children\":\"Lambda function\"}],\" dan pilih \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-0\",{\"children\":\"IngestFunction\"}],\" yang sudah dibuat.\"]}],\"\\n\"]}]\n3a:[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-20\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"img\",\"img-0\",{\"src\":\"/assets/images/lks/tg1.png\",\"alt\":\"Target Group 1\"}]}]\n3b:[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-21\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"img\",\"img-0\",{\"src\":\"/assets/images/lks/tg2.png\",\"alt\":\"Target Group 2\"}]}]\n3c:[\"$\",\"h3\",\"h3-5\",{\"className\":\"font-headline text-2xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mt-10 mb-3\",\"children\":\"6. Application Load Balancer (ALB)\"}]\n3d:[\"$\",\"ul\",\"ul-11\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-0\",{\"children\":\"Buat Application Load Balancer baru.\"}],\"\\n\"]}]\n3e:[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-22\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"img\",\"img-0\",{\"src\":\"/assets/images/lks/alb1.png\",\"alt\":\"ALB Setup 1\"}]}]\n3f:[\"$\",\"ul\",\"ul-12\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-0\",{\"children\":[\"Pilih tipe load balancer yang \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-0\",{\"children\":\"Application Load Balance (ALB)\"}]]}],\"\\n\"]}]\n40:[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-23\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"img\",\"img-0\",{\"src\":\"/assets/images/lks/alb2.png\",\"alt\":\"ALB Setup 2\"}]}]\n41:[\"$\",\"ul\",\"ul-13\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-0\",{\"children\":[\"Lalu konfigurasi nama, schema pakai \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-0\",{\"children\":\"Internal-facing\"}],\" kemudian IP address nya \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-1\",{\"children\":\"IPv4\"}]]}],\"\\n\"]}]\n42:[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-24\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"img\",\"img-0\",{\"src\":\"/assets/images/lks/alb3.png\",\"alt\":\"ALB Setup 3\"}]}]\n43:[\"$\",\"ul\",\"ul-14\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-0\",{\"children\":[\"Lalu configure VPC, AZ, dan Subnet\",\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"ul\",\"ul-0\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-0\",{\"children\":\"VPC: pakai yang sudah di buat sebelumnya\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-1\",{\"children\":\"Pilih AZ, bisa 1 atau 2, sesuai jumlah AZ yang di buat saat, sebagai contoh saya akan add 2 AZ\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-2\",{\"children\":[\"Lalu arahkan Subnet nya ke \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-0\",{\"children\":\"Subnet Public\"}],\" karena ini akan di akses oleh Client\"]}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\"]}]\n44:[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-25\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"img\",\"img-0\",{\"src\":\"/assets/images/lks/alb4.png\",\"alt\":\"ALB Setup 4\"}]}]\n45:[\"$\",\"ul\",\"ul-15\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-0\",{\"children\":[\"Lalu setting SG dan Listener\",\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"ul\",\"ul-0\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-0\",{\"children\":\"SG: arahkan ke SQ yang punya Inbound Port 80 dan 443\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-1\",{\"children\":[\"Listener: arahkan ke \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-0\",{\"children\":\"HTTP\"}],\" dan ke port \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-1\",{\"children\":\"80\"}]]}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\"]}]\n46:[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-26\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"img\",\"img-0\",{\"src\":\"/assets/images/lks/alb5.png\",\"alt\":\"ALB Setup 5\"}]}]\n47:[\"$\",\"ul\",\"ul-16\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-0\",{\"children\":[\"Kemudian Pilih Target group yang sudah di buat sebelumnya, lalu klik \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-0\",{\"children\":\"Create\"}]]}],\"\\n\"]}]\n48:[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-27\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"img\",\"img-0\",{\"src\":\"/assets/images/lks/alb6.png\",\"alt\":\"ALB Setup 6\"}]}]\n49:[\"$\",\"h3\",\"h3-6\",{\"className\":\"font-headline text-2xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mt-10 mb-3\",\"children\":\"7. Set Trigger Lambda\"}]\n4a:[\"$\",\"ul\",\"ul-17\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-0\",{\"children\":[\"Jangan lupa setting \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-white font-bold\",\"children\":\"Trigger\"}],\" di \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-0\",{\"children\":\"IngestFunction\"}],\" agar dia tau kalau dia dipanggil sama ALB. klik \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-1\",{\"children\":\"Add Trigger\"}]]}],\"\\n\"]}]\n4b:[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-28\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"img\",\"img-0\",{\"src\":\"/assets/images/lks/lambda-trigger1.png\",\"alt\":\"Lambda Trigger ALB 1\"}]}]\n4c:[\"$\",\"ul\",\"ul-18\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-0\",{\"children\":[\"Search \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-0\",{\"children\":\"ALB\"}]]}],\"\\n\"]}]\n4d:[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-29\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"img\",\"img-0\",{\"src\":\"/assets/images/lks/lambda-trigger2.png\",\"alt\":\"Lambda Trigger ALB 2\"}]}]\n4e:[\"$\",\"ul\",\"ul-19\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-0\",{\"children\":[\"Pada Bagian \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-0\",{\"children\":\"Application Load Balance\"}],\" pilih ALB yang sudah kita buat\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-1\",{\"children\":[\"Listener arahkan ke \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-0\",{\"children\":\"HTTP:80\"}]]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-2\",{\"children\":[\"Path nya pakai \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-0\",{\"children\":\"/lambda/api/\"}],\". Ini bisa kalian atur bebas, tapi sesuaikan juga pada code lambda \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-1\",{\"children\":\"IngestFunction\"}],\" kalian, agar sesuai.\"]}],\"\\n\"]}]\n4f:[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-30\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"img\",\"img-0\",{\"src\":\"/assets/images/lks/lambda-trigger3.png\",\"alt\":\"Lambda Trigger ALB 3\"}]}]\n50:[\"$\",\"h3\",\"h3-7\",{\"className\":\"font-headline text-2xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mt-10 mb-3\",\"children\":\"8. Lambda Process\"}]\n51:[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-31\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":[\"Nah, ini function kedua, si \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-0\",{\"children\":\"ProcessFunction\"}],\". Tugasnya ngambil data dari SQS terus masukin ke DynamoDB.\"]}]\n52:[\"$\",\"ul\",\"ul-20\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-0\",{\"children\":[\"Buat function baru (misal: \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-0\",{\"children\":\"ProcessFunction\"}],\"). Samakan dengan \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-1\",{\"children\":\"IngestFunction\"}],\".\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-1\",{\"children\":\"Pilih Runtime Python.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-2\",{\"children\":[\"Pilih IAM Role yang ada permission \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-white font-bold\",\"children\":\"sqs:ReceiveMessage\"}],\", \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-1\",{\"className\":\"text-white font-bold\",\"children\":\"sqs:DeleteMessage\"}],\", dan \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-2\",{\"className\":\"text-white font-bold\",\"children\":\"dynamodb:PutItem\"}],\". Ini penting agar Lambda bisa baca dari SQS, hapus pesan setelah selesai, dan nulis ke DynamoDB. di sini saya pakai role \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-0\",{\"children\":\"LabRole\"}]]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-3\",{\"children\":[\"Berikut adalah script untuk \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-0\",{\"children\":\"ProcessFunction\"}],\". Script ini akan dipicu oleh SQS, mem-parsing setiap pesan, dan menyimpannya ke tabel DynamoDB.\"]}],\"\\n\"]}]\n53:[\"$\",\"div\",\"pre-1\",{\"className\":\"rounded-xl overflow-x-auto bg-surface-container-lowest border border-outline-variant/10 my-6 w-full shadow-lg\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center justify-between px-4 py-2 bg-surface-container-high border-b border-outline-variant/10 min-w-max\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"font-label text-[0.6875rem] text-outline uppercase tracking-widest\",\"children\":\"python\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex gap-1.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-error/40\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-primary/40\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-secondary/40\"}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"pre\",null,{\"className\":\"p-6 text-sm font-mono text-primary-fixed/80 leading-relaxed w-full min-w-max whitespace-pre\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-0\",{\"className\":\"language-python\",\"children\":\"import json\\nimport boto3\\nimport os\\n\\ndynamodb = boto3.resource('dynamodb')\\nTABLE_NAME = os.environ.get('TABLE_NAME')\\ntable = dynamodb.Table(TABLE_NAME)\\n\\ndef lambda_handler(event, context):\\n    # SQS mengirimkan data dalam bentuk list 'Records'\\n    for record in event['Records']:\\n        try:\\n            # 1. Parse body dari pesan SQS\\n            payload = json.loads(record['body'])\\n          \\n            # 2. Simpan ke DynamoDB\\n            # Pastikan payload memiliki 'Partition Key' yang sesuai dengan tabel Anda\\n            table.put_item(Item=payload)\\n          \\n            print(f\\\"Berhasil memproses pesan ID: {record['messageId']}\\\")\\n          \\n        except Exception as e:\\n            print(f\\\"Gagal memproses record {record['messageId']}: {str(e)}\\\")\\n            # Jika return error, SQS akan mencoba mengirim ulang pesan ini (Retry)\\n            raise e \\n\\n    return {\\n        'statusCode': 200,\\n        'body': json.dumps('Proses SQS ke DynamoDB selesai')\\n    }\\n\"}]}]]}]\n54:[\"$\",\"ul\",\"ul-21\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-white font-bold\",\"children\":\"Set Trigger SQS:\"}],\" Setting \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-1\",{\"className\":\"text-white font-bold\",\"children\":\"Trigger\"}],\"-nya arahin ke SQS yang udah kita buat. Jadi setiap ada pesan masuk ke SQS, Lambda ini bakal otomatis jalan.\"]}],\"\\n\"]}]\n55:[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-32\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"img\",\"img-0\",{\"src\":\"/assets/images/lks/lambda-trigger-sqs1.png\",\"alt\":\"Lambda Trigger SQS 1\"}]}]\n56:[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-33\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"img\",\"img-0\",{\"src\":\"/assets/images/lks/lambda-trigger-sqs2.png\",\"alt\":\"Lambda Trigger SQS 2\"}]}]\n57:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"h2-0\",{\"className\":\"font-headline text-3xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mt-12 mb-4\",\"children\":\"Tabel Konfigurasi Penting\"}]\n58:[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-34\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":\"Biar gak ada yang kelewat, cek tabel konfigurasi ini ya:\"}]\n59:[\"$\",\"table\",\"table-0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"thead\",\"thead-0\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"tr\",\"tr-0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"th\",\"th-0\",{\"style\":{\"textAlign\":\"left\"},\"children\":\"Komponen\"}],[\"$\",\"th\",\"th-1\",{\"style\":{\"textAlign\":\"left\"},\"children\":\"Konfigurasi\"}],[\"$\",\"th\",\"th-2\",{\"style\":{\"textAlign\":\"left\"},\"children\":\"Penjelasan\"}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"tbody\",\"tbody-0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"tr\",\"tr-0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"td-0\",{\"style\":{\"textAlign\":\"left\"},\"children\":[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-white font-bold\",\"children\":\"IAM Role Lambda\"}]}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"td-1\",{\"style\":{\"textAlign\":\"left\"},\"children\":[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-0\",{\"children\":\"LabRole\"}]}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"td-2\",{\"style\":{\"textAlign\":\"left\"},\"children\":[\"Role ini buat Lambda bisa kirim ke SQS dan tulis ke DB. (Best practice: pake\",[\"$\",\"em\",\"em-0\",{\"children\":\"least privilege\"}],\" ya!)\"]}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"tr-1\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"td-0\",{\"style\":{\"textAlign\":\"left\"},\"children\":[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-white font-bold\",\"children\":\"SQS Visibility Timeout\"}]}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"td-1\",{\"style\":{\"textAlign\":\"left\"},\"children\":\"> Lambda Timeout\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"td-2\",{\"style\":{\"textAlign\":\"left\"},\"children\":\"Durasi pesan \\\"hilang\\\" dari antrian saat diproses. Harus lebih lama dari durasi eksekusi Lambda Consumer.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"tr-2\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"td-0\",{\"style\":{\"textAlign\":\"left\"},\"children\":[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-white font-bold\",\"children\":\"Lambda Trigger\"}]}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"td-1\",{\"style\":{\"textAlign\":\"left\"},\"children\":\"Batch Size\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"td-2\",{\"style\":{\"textAlign\":\"left\"},\"children\":\"Jumlah pesan yang diambil Lambda Consumer sekali jalan. Default 10, bisa di-tuning sesuai kebutuhan.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"tr-3\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"td-0\",{\"style\":{\"textAlign\":\"left\"},\"children\":[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-white font-bold\",\"children\":\"ALB Listener\"}]}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"td-1\",{\"style\":{\"textAlign\":\"left\"},\"children\":\"Port 80 (HTTP)\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"td-2\",{\"style\":{\"textAlign\":\"left\"},\"children\":\"Forwarding rule ke Target Group Lambda Ingest.\"}]]}]]}]]}]\n5a:[\"$\",\"h3\",\"h3-8\",{\"className\":\"font-headline text-2xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mt-10 mb-3\",\"children\":\"Validasi & Testing\"}]\n5b:[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-35\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":\"Saatnya pembuktian! Apakah sistem kita jalan mulus?\"}]\n5c:[\"$\",\"ol\",\"ol-1\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-0\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-0\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-white font-bold\",\"children\":\"Hit API pake Postman\"}],\"\\nKirim request POST ke DNS name ALB kalian dengan path \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-0\",{\"children\":\"/lambda/api\"}],\". Body-nya berisi data JSON yang mau disimpan.\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"ul\",\"ul-0\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-0\",{\"children\":[\"Klik pada url atas, pastekan URL hasil ALB kalian, kemudian tambahin juga path nya \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-0\",{\"children\":\"/lambda/api\"}],\".\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-1\",{\"children\":[\"Lalu kalian Ubah Method nya jadi \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-0\",{\"children\":\"POST\"}],\" seperti pada gambar berikut ini.\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-2\",{\"children\":[\"lalu klik \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-0\",{\"children\":\"body\"}],\" untuk menambahkan data, misal saya pakai data berikut ini, lalu klik \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-1\",{\"children\":\"Send\"}],\".\"]}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"div\",\"pre-0\",{\"className\":\"rounded-xl overflow-x-auto bg-surface-container-lowest border border-outline-variant/10 my-6 w-full shadow-lg\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center justify-between px-4 py-2 bg-surface-container-high border-b border-outline-variant/10 min-w-max\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"font-label text-[0.6875rem] text-outline uppercase tracking-widest\",\"children\":\"json\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex gap-1.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-error/40\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-primary/40\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-secondary/40\"}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"pre\",null,{\"className\":\"p-6 text-sm font-mono text-primary-fixed/80 leading-relaxed w-full min-w-max whitespace-pre\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-0\",{\"className\":\"language-json\",\"children\":\"{\\\"order_id\\\": \\\"123\\\", \\\"item\\\":\\\"Kopi Susu\\\", \\\"qty\\\": 2}\\n\"}]}]]}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\"]}]\n5d:[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-36\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"img\",\"img-0\",{\"src\":\"/assets/images/lks/postman1.png\",\"alt\":\"Postman Test\"}]}]\n5e:[\"$\",\"ol\",\"ol-2\",{\"start\":2,\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-white font-bold\",\"children\":\"Cek DynamoDB\"}],\"\\nDan... \",[\"$\",\"em\",\"em-0\",{\"children\":\"voila\"}],\"! Datanya udah masuk ke tabel DynamoDB dengan rapi.\"]}],\"\\n\"]}]\n5f:[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-37\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"img\",\"img-0\",{\"src