npa bikin server meledak atau database \",\"$L4\",\"? Jawabannya adalah \",\"$L5\",\" alias arsitektur yang gak saling nempel banget.\"]}],\"\\n\",\"$L6\",\"\\n\",\"$L7\",\"\\n\",\"$L8\",\"\\n\",\"$L9\",\"\\n\",\"$La\",\"\\n\",\"$Lb\",\"\\n\",\"$Lc\",\"\\n\",\"$Ld\",\"\\n\",\"$Le\",\"\\n\",\"$Lf\",\"\\n\",\"$L10\",\"\\n\",\"$L11\",\"\\n\",\"$L12\",\"\\n\",\"$L13\",\"\\n\",\"$L14\",\"\\n\",\"$L15\",\"\\n\",\"$L16\",\"\\n\",\"$L17\",\"\\n\",\"$L18\",\"\\n\",\"$L19\",\"\\n\",\"$L1a\",\"\\n\",\"$L1b\",\"\\n\",\"$L1c\",\"\\n\",\"$L1d\",\"\\n\",\"$L1e\",\"\\n\",\"$L1f\",\"\\n\",\"$L20\",\"\\n\",\"$L21\",\"\\n\",\"$L22\",\"\\n\",\"$L23\",\"\\n\",\"$L24\",\"\\n\",\"$L25\",\"\\n\",\"$L26\",\"\\n\",\"$L27\",\"\\n\",\"$L28\",\"\\n\",\"$L29\",\"\\n\",\"$L2a\",\"\\n\",\"$L2b\",\"\\n\",\"$L2c\",\"\\n\",\"$L2d\",\"\\n\",\"$L2e\",\"\\n\",\"$L2f\",\"\\n\",\"$L30\",\"\\n\",\"$L31\",\"\\n\",\"$L32\",\"\\n\",\"$L33\",\"\\n\",\"$L34\",\"\\n\",\"$L35\",\"\\n\",\"$L36\",\"\\n\",\"$L37\",\"\\n\",\"$L38\",\"\\n\",\"$L39\",\"\\n\",\"$L3a\",\"\\n\",\"$L3b\",\"\\n\",\"$L3c\",\"\\n\",\"$L3d\",\"\\n\",\"$L3e\",\"\\n\",\"$L3f\",\"\\n\",\"$L40\",\"\\n\",\"$L41\",\"\\n\",\"$L42\",\"\\n\",\"$L43\",\"\\n\",\"$L44\",\"\\n\",\"$L45\",\"\\n\",\"$L46\",\"\\n\",\"$L47\",\"\\n\",\"$L48\",\"\\n\",\"$L49\",\"\\n\",\"$L4a\",\"\\n\",\"$L4b\",\"\\n\",\"$L4c\",\"\\n\",\"$L4d\",\"\\n\",\"$L4e\",\"\\n\",\"$L4f\",\"\\n\",\"$L50\",\"\\n\",\"$L51\",\"\\n\",\"$L52\",\"\\n\",\"</br>\\nGimana? Seru kan mainan arsitektur *serverless*? Dengan pola ini, aplikasi kalian bakal jauh lebih *resilient* dan siap nge-handle trafik badai sekalipun.\",\"\\n\",\"$L53\"]}]}]}]]}],\"$L54\"],[\"$L55\"],\"$L56\"]}],\"isPartial\":false,\"staleTime\":300,\"varyParams\":null,\"buildId\":\"hn3-JziO5VHbMuGjkEy_d\"}\n4:[\"$\",\"em\",\"em-0\",{\"children\":\"timeout\"}]\n5:[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-1\",{\"className\":\"text-white font-bold\",\"children\":\"Decoupled Architecture\"}]\n6:[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-1\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":[\"Di lab kali ini, kita bakal mainan sama \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-white font-bold\",\"children\":\"ALB (Application Load Balancer)\"}],\", \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-1\",{\"className\":\"text-white font-bold\",\"children\":\"Lambda\"}],\", \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-2\",{\"className\":\"text-white font-bold\",\"children\":\"SQS (Simple Queue Service)\"}],\", dan \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-3\",{\"className\":\"text-white font-bold\",\"children\":\"DynamoDB\"}],\". Intinya, kita mau bikin sistem yang \",[\"$\",\"em\",\"em-0\",{\"children\":\"scalable\"}],\" dan \",[\"$\",\"em\",\"em-1\",{\"children\":\"reliable\"}],\". Jadi kalau ada lonjakan trafik, sistem kita tetep santuy karena ada antrian (SQS) yang nampung beban sebelum diproses ke database.\"]}]\n7:[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-2\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":\"Gas langsung aja kita bedah arsitekturnya!\"}]\n8:[\"$\",\"h1\",\"h1-0\",{\"children\":\"Pembahasan Arsitektur\"}]\n9:[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-3\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"img\",\"img-0\",{\"src\":\"/assets/images/lks/topology-serverless.png\",\"alt\":\"topology\"}]}]\na:[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-4\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":[\"Konsepnya sederhana tapi \",[\"$\",\"em\",\"em-0\",{\"children\":\"powerful\"}],\". Kita gak mau user nunggu lama cuma buat nunggu proses database selesai. Jadi kita pake metode \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-white font-bold\",\"children\":\"Asinkronus\"}],\".\"]}]\nb:[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-5\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-white font-bold\",\"children\":\"Alur Datanya kayak gini:\"}]}]\nc:[\"$\",\"ol\",\"ol-0\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-white font-bold\",\"children\":\"User\"}],\" ngirim request HTTP (misal: menambah barang) ke \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-1\",{\"className\":\"text-white font-bold\",\"children\":\"ALB\"}],\".\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-1\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-white font-bold\",\"children\":\"ALB\"}],\" nerusin request ke \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-1\",{\"className\":\"text-white font-bold\",\"children\":\"Lambda Ingest\"}],\".\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-2\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-white font-bold\",\"children\":\"Lambda Ingest\"}],\" gak langsung nulis ke DB, tapi dia cuma \\\"nitip\\\" pesan ke \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-1\",{\"className\":\"text-white font-bold\",\"children\":\"SQS\"}],\". Abis itu dia langsung bilang \\\"Oke, diterima\\\" ke User. Cepet kan?\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-3\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-white font-bold\",\"children\":\"SQS\"}],\" nampung pesan-pesan itu dalam antrian.\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-4\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-white font-bold\",\"children\":\"Lambda Process\"}],\" (yang dipicu oleh SQS) bakal ngambil pesan dari antrian dan memprosesnya (misal: simpen ke \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-1\",{\"className\":\"text-white font-bold\",\"children\":\"DynamoDB\"}],\").\"]}],\"\\n\"]}]\nd:[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-6\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":\"Dengan cara ini, frontend user bakal ngerasa aplikasinya ngebut banget, padahal di belakang layar prosesnya lagi ngantri dengan rapih.\"}]\ne:[\"$\",\"h1\",\"h1-1\",{\"children\":\"Langkah Implementasi\"}]\nf:[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-7\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":[\"Biar gak bingung, kita bagi jadi beberapa \",[\"$\",\"em\",\"em-0\",{\"children\":\"part\"}],\" ya. Siapin kopi kalian, \",[\"$\",\"em\",\"em-1\",{\"children\":\"let's dive in!\"}]]}]\n10:[\"$\",\"h3\",\"h3-0\",{\"className\":\"font-headline text-2xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mt-10 mb-3\",\"children\":\"1. persyaratan awal\"}]\n11:[\"$\",\"ul\",\"ul-0\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-0\",{\"children\":[\"VPC sudah ada dengan configurasi\",\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"ul\",\"ul-0\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-0\",{\"children\":\"4 Subnet (Public dan Private masing - masing 2)\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-1\",{\"children\":\"Internet Gateway\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-2\",{\"children\":\"RTB untuk subnet Public dan RTB untuk masing - masing subnet Private\"}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-1\",{\"children\":[\"SG dengan Inbound Port\",\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"ul\",\"ul-0\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-0\",{\"children\":\"HTTP: 80\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-1\",{\"children\":\"HTTPS: 443\"}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\"]}]\n12:[\"$\",\"h3\",\"h3-1\",{\"className\":\"font-headline text-2xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mt-10 mb-3\",\"children\":\"2. Siapin Database (DynamoDB)\"}]\n13:[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-8\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":[\"Pertama, kita butuh tempat buat nyimpen data akhirnya. Kita pake DynamoDB karena dia \",[\"$\",\"em\",\"em-0\",{\"children\":\"serverless\"}],\" dan \",[\"$\",\"em\",\"em-1\",{\"children\":\"fast\"}],\".\"]}]\n14:[\"$\",\"ul\",\"ul-1\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-0\",{\"children\":[\"Buka console DynamoDB, klik \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-white font-bold\",\"children\":\"Create table\"}],\".\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-1\",{\"children\":[\"Isi nama tabel dan Partition key-nya sesuai kebutuhan. berikut contoh yang saya pakai, setelah itu click \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-0\",{\"children\":\"Create\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"ul\",\"ul-0\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-0\",{\"children\":[\"Partition Key: \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-0\",{\"children\":\"order_id\"}]]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-1\",{\"children\":[\"Sort Key: \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-0\",{\"children\":\"item\"}]]}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\"]}]\n15:[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-9\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"img\",\"img-0\",{\"src\":\"/assets/images/lks/dynamodb1.png\",\"alt\":\"DynamoDB Setup\"}]}]\n16:[\"$\",\"h3\",\"h3-2\",{\"className\":\"font-headline text-2xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mt-10 mb-3\",\"children\":\"3. Buat Queue Service (SQS)\"}]\n17:[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-10\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":\"Ini dia pahlawan kita, si penampung load data.\"}]\n18:[\"$\",\"ul\",\"ul-2\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-0\",{\"children\":[\"Masuk ke service SQS, pilih \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-white font-bold\",\"children\":\"Create queue\"}],\".\"]}],\"\\n\"]}]\n19:[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-11\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"img\",\"img-0\",{\"src\":\"/assets/images/lks/sqs1.png\",\"alt\":\"SQS Setup 1\"}]}]\n1a:[\"$\",\"ul\",\"ul-3\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-0\",{\"children\":[\"Pilih tipe \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-white font-bold\",\"children\":\"Standard\"}],\" aja biar throughput-nya tinggi dan prosesnya lebih cepat. Lalu fill nama nya, exp \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-0\",{\"children\":\"vian-sqs\"}],\". lalu klik \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-1\",{\"children\":\"Create\"}],\".\"]}],\"\\n\"]}]\n1b:[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-12\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"img\",\"img-0\",{\"src\":\"/assets/images/lks/sqs2.png\",\"alt\":\"SQS Setup 2\"}]}]\n1c:[\"$\",\"ul\",\"ul-4\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-0\",{\"children\":\"Kemudian simpan link hasil SQS untuk di pakai di Lambda Ingest.\"}],\"\\n\"]}]\n1d:[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-13\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"img\",\"img-0\",{\"src\":\"/assets/images/lks/sqs3.png\",\"alt\":\"SQS Setup 3\"}]}]\n1e:[\"$\",\"h3\",\"h3-3\",{\"className\":\"font-headline text-2xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mt-10 mb-3\",\"children\":\"4. Lambda Ingest\"}]\n1f:[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-14\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":[\"Sekarang kita buat Lambda function pertama, si \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-0\",{\"children\":\"IngestFunction\"}],\". Tugasnya cuma nerima data dari ALB terus lempar ke SQS.\"]}]\n20:[\"$\",\"ul\",\"ul-5\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-0\",{\"children\":[\"Buat function baru, kasih nama yang kece (misal: \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-0\",{\"children\":\"Ingest-vian\"}],\").\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-1\",{\"children\":\"Pilih Runtime Python.\"}],\"\\n\"]}]\n21:[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-15\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"img\",\"img-0\",{\"src\":\"/assets/images/lks/lambda1.png\",\"alt\":\"Create Lambda Ingest 1\"}]}]\n22:[\"$\",\"ul\",\"ul-6\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-0\",{\"children\":[\"Pastiin IAM Role-nya punya akses buat \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-white font-bold\",\"children\":\"sqs:SendMessage\"}],\" ke SQS Queue yang udah kita buat. Pada kali ini karena saya pakai AWS Academy, jadi bisa pakai \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-0\",{\"children\":\"LabRole\"}]]}],\"\\n\"]}]\n23:[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-16\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"img\",\"img-0\",{\"src\":\"/assets/images/lks/lambda2.png\",\"alt\":\"Create Lambda Ingest 2\"}]}]\n24:[\"$\",\"ul\",\"ul-7\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-0\",{\"children\":\"Enable konfigurasi VPC yang akan di pakai di Lammbda Ingest.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-1\",{\"children\":\"Pilih subnet Private sesuai dengan topologi.\"}],\"\\n\"]}]\n25:[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-17\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"img\",\"img-0\",{\"src\":\"/assets/images/lks/lambda3.png\",\"alt\":\"Create Lambda Ingest 3\"}]}]\n26:[\"$\",\"ul\",\"ul-8\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-0\",{\"children\":\"Pilih Security Group yang sudah di buat dengan Inbound port 80 dan 443.\"}],\"\\n\"]}]\n27:[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-18\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"img\",\"img-0\",{\"src\":\"/assets/images/lks/lambda4.png\",\"alt\":\"Create Lambda Ingest 4\"}]}]\n28:[\"$\",\"ul\",\"ul-9\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-0\",{\"children\":[\"Berikut adalah script untuk \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-0\",{\"children\":\"IngestFunction\"}],\". Script ini akan menerima event dari ALB, mengambil body request, dan mengirimkannya sebagai pesan ke SQS.\"]}],\"\\n\"]}]\n57:T4d5,import json\nimport boto3\nimport os\n\n# Inisialisasi client di luar handler agar lebih cepat (Global)\nsqs = boto3.client('sqs')\nQUEUE_URL = \"{PASTE-URL-SQS}\"\n\ndef lambda_handler(event, context):\n    print(\"EVENT DARI ALB:\", json.dumps(event))\n  \n    path = event.get('path', '/')\n    method = event.get('httpMethod', 'UNKNOWN')\n  \n    # Sesuaikan dengan path yang ada di trigger, exp: /lambda/api\n    if path == \"/lambda/api\" and method == \"POST\":\n        try:\n            body_raw = event.get('body', '{}')\n          \n            sqs.send_message(\n                QueueUrl=QUEUE_URL,\n                MessageBody=body_raw\n            )\n          \n            return {\n                \"statusCode\": 200,\n                \"headers\": {\"Content-Type\": \"application/json\"},\n                \"body\": json.dumps({\"status\": \"Success\", \"msg\": \"Data masuk antrean SQS\"})\n            }\n        except Exception as e:\n            print(f\"CRITICAL ERROR SQS: {str(e)}\")\n            return {\n                \"statusCode\": 500,\n                \"body\": json.dumps({\"error\": f\"Gagal kirim ke SQS: {str(e)}\"})\n            }\n  \n    else:\n        return {\n            \"statusCode\": 404,\n            \"body\": json.dumps({\"error\": f\"Path {path} salah\"})\n        }\n29:[\"$\",\"div\",\"pre-0\",{\"className\":\"rounded-xl overflow-x-auto bg-surface-container-lowest border border-outline-variant/10 my-6 w-full shadow-lg\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center justify-between px-4 py-2 bg-surface-container-high border-b border-outline-variant/10 min-w-max\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"font-label text-[0.6875rem] text-outline uppercase tracking-widest\",\"children\":\"python\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex gap-1.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-error/40\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-primary/40\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-secondary/40\"}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"pre\",null,{\"className\":\"p-6 text-sm font-mono text-primary-fixed/80 leading-relaxed w-full min-w-max whitespace-pre\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-0\",{\"className\":\"language-python\",\"children\":\"$57\"}]}]]}]\n2a:[\"$\",\"h3\",\"h3-4\",{\"className\":\"font-headline text-2xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mt-10 mb-3\",\"children\":\"5. Target Group\"}]\n2b:[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-19\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":[\"Biar \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-0\",{\"children\":\"IngestFunction\"}],\" bisa diakses dari internet, kita butuh ALB.\"]}]\n2c:[\"$\",\"ul\",\"ul-10\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-0\",{\"children\":[\"Buat Target Group baru, pilih target type \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-white font-bold\",\"children\":\"Lambda function\"}],\" dan pilih \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-0\",{\"children\":\"IngestFunction\"}],\" yang sudah dibuat.\"]}],\"\\n\"]}]\n2d:[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-20\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"img\",\"img-0\",{\"src\":\"/assets/images/lks/tg1.png\",\"alt\":\"Target Group 1\"}]}]\n2e:[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-21\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"img\",\"img-0\",{\"src\":\"/assets/images/lks/tg2.png\",\"alt\":\"Target Group 2\"}]}]\n2f:[\"$\",\"h3\",\"h3-5\",{\"className\":\"font-headline text-2xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mt-10 mb-3\",\"children\":\"6. Application Load Balancer (ALB)\"}]\n30:[\"$\",\"ul\",\"ul-11\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-0\",{\"children\":\"Buat Application Load Balancer baru.\"}],\"\\n\"]}]\n31:[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-22\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"img\",\"img-0\",{\"src\":\"/assets/images/lks/alb1.png\",\"alt\":\"ALB Setup 1\"}]}]\n32:[\"$\",\"ul\",\"ul-12\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-0\",{\"children\":[\"Pilih tipe load balancer yang \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-0\",{\"children\":\"Application Load Balance (ALB)\"}]]}],\"\\n\"]}]\n33:[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-23\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"img\",\"img-0\",{\"src\":\"/assets/images/lks/alb2.png\",\"alt\":\"ALB Setup 2\"}]}]\n34:[\"$\",\"ul\",\"ul-13\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-0\",{\"children\":[\"Lalu konfigurasi nama, schema pakai \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-0\",{\"children\":\"Internal-facing\"}],\" kemudian IP address nya \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-1\",{\"children\":\"IPv4\"}]]}],\"\\n\"]}]\n35:[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-24\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"img\",\"img-0\",{\"src\":\"/assets/images/lks/alb3.png\",\"alt\":\"ALB Setup 3\"}]}]\n36:[\"$\",\"ul\",\"ul-14\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-0\",{\"children\":[\"Lalu configure VPC, AZ, dan Subnet\",\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"ul\",\"ul-0\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-0\",{\"children\":\"VPC: pakai yang sudah di buat sebelumnya\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-1\",{\"children\":\"Pilih AZ, bisa 1 atau 2, sesuai jumlah AZ yang di buat saat, sebagai contoh saya akan add 2 AZ\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-2\",{\"children\":[\"Lalu arahkan Subnet nya ke \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-0\",{\"children\":\"Subnet Public\"}],\" karena ini akan di akses oleh Client\"]}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\"]}]\n37:[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-25\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"img\",\"img-0\",{\"src\":\"/assets/images/lks/alb4.png\",\"alt\":\"ALB Setup 4\"}]}]\n38:[\"$\",\"ul\",\"ul-15\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-0\",{\"children\":[\"Lalu setting SG dan Listener\",\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"ul\",\"ul-0\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-0\",{\"children\":\"SG: arahkan ke SQ yang punya Inbound Port 80 dan 443\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-1\",{\"children\":[\"Listener: arahkan ke \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-0\",{\"children\":\"HTTP\"}],\" dan ke port \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-1\",{\"children\":\"80\"}]]}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\"]}]\n39:[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-26\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"img\",\"img-0\",{\"src\":\"/assets/images/lks/alb5.png\",\"alt\":\"ALB Setup 5\"}]}]\n3a:[\"$\",\"ul\",\"ul-16\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-0\",{\"children\":[\"Kemudian Pilih Target group yang sudah di buat sebelumnya, lalu klik \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-0\",{\"children\":\"Create\"}]]}],\"\\n\"]}]\n3b:[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-27\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"img\",\"img-0\",{\"src\":\"/assets/images/lks/alb6.png\",\"alt\":\"ALB Setup 6\"}]}]\n3c:[\"$\",\"h3\",\"h3-6\",{\"className\":\"font-headline text-2xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mt-10 mb-3\",\"children\":\"7. Set Trigger Lambda\"}]\n3d:[\"$\",\"ul\",\"ul-17\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-0\",{\"children\":[\"Jangan lupa setting \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-white font-bold\",\"children\":\"Trigger\"}],\" di \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-0\",{\"children\":\"IngestFunction\"}],\" agar dia tau kalau dia dipanggil sama ALB. klik \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-1\",{\"children\":\"Add Trigger\"}]]}],\"\\n\"]}]\n3e:[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-28\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"img\",\"img-0\",{\"src\":\"/assets/images/lks/lambda-trigger1.png\",\"alt\":\"Lambda Trigger ALB 1\"}]}]\n3f:[\"$\",\"ul\",\"ul-18\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-0\",{\"children\":[\"Search \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-0\",{\"children\":\"ALB\"}]]}],\"\\n\"]}]\n40:[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-29\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"img\",\"img-0\",{\"src\":\"/assets/images/lks/lambda-trigger2.png\",\"alt\":\"Lambda Trigger ALB 2\"}]}]\n41:[\"$\",\"ul\",\"ul-19\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-0\",{\"children\":[\"Pada Bagian \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-0\",{\"children\":\"Application Load Balance\"}],\" pilih ALB yang sudah kita buat\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-1\",{\"children\":[\"Listener arahkan ke \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-0\",{\"children\":\"HTTP:80\"}]]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-2\",{\"children\":[\"Path nya pakai \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-0\",{\"children\":\"/lambda/api/\"}],\". Ini bisa kalian atur bebas, tapi sesuaikan juga pada code lambda \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-1\",{\"children\":\"IngestFunction\"}],\" kalian, agar sesuai.\"]}],\"\\n\"]}]\n42:[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-30\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"img\",\"img-0\",{\"src\":\"/assets/images/lks/lambda-trigger3.png\",\"alt\":\"Lambda Trigger ALB 3\"}]}]\n43:[\"$\",\"h3\",\"h3-7\",{\"className\":\"font-headline text-2xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mt-10 mb-3\",\"children\":\"8. Lambda Process\"}]\n44:[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-31\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":[\"Nah, ini function kedua, si \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-0\",{\"children\":\"ProcessFunction\"}],\". Tugasnya ngambil data dari SQS terus masukin ke DynamoDB.\"]}]\n45:[\"$\",\"ul\",\"ul-20\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-0\",{\"children\":[\"Buat function baru (misal: \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-0\",{\"children\":\"ProcessFunction\"}],\"). Samakan dengan \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-1\",{\"children\":\"IngestFunction\"}],\".\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-1\",{\"children\":\"Pilih Runtime Python.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-2\",{\"children\":[\"Pilih IAM Role yang ada permission \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-white font-bold\",\"children\":\"sqs:ReceiveMessage\"}],\", \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-1\",{\"className\":\"text-white font-bold\",\"children\":\"sqs:DeleteMessage\"}],\", dan \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-2\",{\"className\":\"text-white font-bold\",\"children\":\"dynamodb:PutItem\"}],\". Ini penting agar Lambda bisa baca dari SQS, hapus pesan setelah selesai, dan nulis ke DynamoDB. di sini saya pakai role \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-0\",{\"children\":\"LabRole\"}]]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-3\",{\"children\":[\"Berikut adalah script untuk \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-0\",{\"children\":\"ProcessFunction\"}],\". Script ini akan dipicu oleh SQS, mem-parsing setiap pesan, dan menyimpannya ke tabel DynamoDB.\"]}],\"\\n\"]}]\n46:[\"$\",\"div\",\"pre-1\",{\"className\":\"rounded-xl overflow-x-auto bg-surface-container-lowest border border-outline-variant/10 my-6 w-full shadow-lg\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center justify-between px-4 py-2 bg-surface-container-high border-b border-outline-variant/10 min-w-max\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"font-label text-[0.6875rem] text-outline uppercase tracking-widest\",\"children\":\"python\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex gap-1.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-error/40\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-primary/40\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-secondary/40\"}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"pre\",null,{\"className\":\"p-6 text-sm font-mono text-primary-fixed/80 leading-relaxed w-full min-w-max whitespace-pre\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-0\",{\"className\":\"language-python\",\"children\":\"import json\\nimport boto3\\nimport os\\n\\ndynamodb = boto3.resource('dynamodb')\\nTABLE_NAME = os.environ.get('TABLE_NAME')\\ntable = dynamodb.Table(TABLE_NAME)\\n\\ndef lambda_handler(event, context):\\n    # SQS mengirimkan data dalam bentuk list 'Records'\\n    for record in event['Records']:\\n        try:\\n            # 1. Parse body dari pesan SQS\\n            payload = json.loads(record['body'])\\n          \\n            # 2. Simpan ke DynamoDB\\n            # Pastikan payload memiliki 'Partition Key' yang sesuai dengan tabel Anda\\n            table.put_item(Item=payload)\\n          \\n            print(f\\\"Berhasil memproses pesan ID: {record['messageId']}\\\")\\n          \\n        except Exception as e:\\n            print(f\\\"Gagal memproses record {record['messageId']}: {str(e)}\\\")\\n            # Jika return error, SQS akan mencoba mengirim ulang pesan ini (Retry)\\n            raise e \\n\\n    return {\\n        'statusCode': 200,\\n        'body': json.dumps('Proses SQS ke DynamoDB selesai')\\n    }\\n\"}]}]]}]\n47:[\"$\",\"ul\",\"ul-21\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-white font-bold\",